@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Lay danh sach bai tap → 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 2. Lay chi tiet bai tap 1 → 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### 3. Bai tap khong ton tai → 404 Not Found
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### 4. Nop bai hop le → 201 Created
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"
}

### 5. Doc lai luot nop vua tao → 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 6. Nop bai voi du lieu rong → 400 Bad Request
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 7. Luot nop khong ton tai → 404 Not Found
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
### 8. Nop vao bai tap khong ton tai → 404
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"
}

### 9. Nop vao bai tap da dong → 400
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"
}

### 10. Thieu repositoryUrl → 400
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001"
}

### 11. Gui body khong co Content-Type → 415
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"
}

### 12. JSON sai cu phap → 400
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",

### 13. Phuong thuc khong duoc ho tro → 405
PUT {{api}}/api/assignments/1